				<p.InfoTipDescription xmlns="http://www.ni.com/PlatformFramework">"The &lt;B&gt;error in&lt;/B&gt; cluster can accept error information wired from VIs previously called.  Use this information to decide if any functionality should be bypassed in the event of errors from other VIs.\n\nThe pop-up option &lt;B&gt;Explain Error&lt;/B&gt; (or Explain Warning) gives more information about the error displayed. "</p.InfoTipDescription>
